OL,3,GNEWSADisruption expected as yellow wind
OL,4,Awarning issued
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are being urged to take care and
OL,7,Fprepare for further disruption amid a
OL,8,Fwarning for strong winds.
OL,10,FThe Met Office issued a yellow warning
OL,11,Ffor wind which covers all of Cornwall
OL,12,Fand part of Devon from 18:00 GMT until
OL,13,F03:00 on Tuesday.
OL,15,FComing hot on the heels of storms
OL,16,FAusten and Boelo, forecasters said
OL,17,Fgusts of up to 65mph (105km/h) were
OL,18,Fexpected along the coast with "heavy
OL,19,Frain at times", while transport delays
OL,20,Fwere "likely" as well as the potential
OL,21,Ffor power cuts.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
