OL,3,GNEWSADisruption expected as yellow wind
OL,4,Awarning issued
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmily Trapnell, from Falmouth
OL,7,FCoastguard, said: "Just be really
OL,8,Fcautious when out and about around the
OL,9,Fcoast these next few days."
